WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.310
A maze game gives you
135 seconds to escape.

2
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.070
The program keeps the
countdown in one number,

3
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.690
and it drops by one every second.

4
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:13.510
But the timer in the
corner never shows 135.

5
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.630
It shows 2 minutes and 15 seconds.

6
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.410
Where do the 2 and the 15 come from?

7
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:25.010
Dividing 135 by 60 on a
calculator shows 2.25.

8
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.290
So is it 2 minutes and 25 seconds?

9
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:33.190
In this mission, you'll meet variables:
named places in memory whose values can

10
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.270
change.

11
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.230
And you'll see why whole numbers and
numbers with a fractional part are different

12
00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.690
data types.

13
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:45.520
Your mission: work out how the game
turns 135 seconds into two fifteen.
